			"notes": "This mod adds a series of new obsidian blocks, all with the same blast resistance as obsidian. It also adds a steel chest with a storage capacity of 19x7 (a total of 133 slots) and blast resistance equivalent to obsidian, making it the best choice for large-scale storage and valuable items. Additionally, concrete has been ported and can be poured by using newly added colored cement buckets. The usage is similar to the cement bucket in BTW (you can press R/U to view recipes and uses)."
